scene B: {colleague} has swapped out of every night this month. {N} has noticed, and has had enough of being the one who never says no.
scene R: {N} sits up with a thudding heart and, for a moment, wants to hurl the phone at the wall.
scene G: {partner} turns over in the dark and says nothing. Death keeps its own hours, and has never once asked {N} for permission.
- W | get dressed, go, and do it as carefully as the very first time | v: benevolence, conformity | identity | chance: 92
