- U>R | learn a breathing routine from a grief counsellor and use it in the car | v: self-direction | habit | self_control: + | mark: learned a skill | chance: 77
- B>G | refuse weekend calls this month, whoever complains, and stay home | v: benevolence | chance: 65
- R>W | ring the backup colleague now, and offer to go out to the family together | v: benevolence, conformity | chance: 80
