scene U: {N} reads the editor's notes three times. They are not foolish notes; they point at something the last chapter has not earned.
scene B: A contract with a real publisher, an advance, a launch: all of it rests on one chapter {N} could rewrite in a week.
scene R: The ending is the truest thing {N} has ever written. Changing it feels like tearing a page out of {Ns} own life.
scene G: The book grew its ending the way a tree grows its shape. {N} is not sure it can be pruned without killing it.
