- U | sign the agency's contract only once the worst clauses are bargained out | v: achievement, security | binds | chance: 45
- B | sign early and take the pick of the best bookings | v: achievement, power | chance: 90
- R | join the boycott and picket the courthouse steps with the others | v: universalism, self-direction | identity | body: light | mark: defied an authority | chance: 25
- G | keep taking the cases from your own community, whatever the rate | v: benevolence | identity | chance: 72
- W>G | write to the judges about the families left without a proper interpreter | v: universalism | chance: 20
- U>W | document every hearing the new system got wrong, and publish the report | v: universalism | identity | chance: 20
- B>U | use the quiet months to qualify in a rarer language that pays more | v: achievement | mark: learned a skill | chance: 65
- R>B | leave the courts for conference work, and charge what you are worth | v: achievement, self-direction | drops: court interpreter | chance: 50
- G>R | spend the empty days with your family, and let the anger go | v: benevolence, hedonism | chance: 75
